      perform Arm calibration;
      drive 4000000000 0)
    else ())
  else ()
*)

(* Correctly rejected by the typechecker: a session that commands zero
   setpoints at Arm, to stop the wheels, before it arms the robot, a motion
   command after the calibration:

     Typing error: Variable `calibrated` is unboxed with grade
       `{ShowTextAt; !1000; (Receive; Report; !400)^[1, 500]; Command}`
       accumulated since it was bound, which is not below its box grade
       `{[1000, 600000] & ~Command}`
       ...
*)
